        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "223. Joint Training Committees may be established at each medical center. The committees shall each consist of not more than three (3) representatives from management and three (3) representatives from the Union, and shall meet not more than three (3) hours per month unless the time is extended by mutual agreement. Such time in these meetings shall be consistent with the operational requirements of the medical center.",
            "block_bbox": [
